WEBVTT

00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:41.876
A painting in full color, then several different black-and-white images of it.

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:54.555
Someone pulls a paint chip from an object.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.684
A spectroscope aimed at a painting. It displays a spiky graph.

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:06.650
A spectrum including ultraviolet, visible light, and infrared. Visible light is from 380 to 750 nanometers, with ultraviolet shorter than 380 and infrared longer than 750.

